{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25944","headline":"巢乌行 · 鲍溶","name":"巢乌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌生几子林萧条，雄乌求食雌守巢。\n夜愁风雨巢倾覆，常见一乌巢下宿。\n日长雏饥雄未回，雌鸟下巢去哀哀。\n野田春尽少遗谷，寻食不得饥飞来。\n黄雀亦引数青雀，雀飞未远乌惊落。\n既分青雀噉尔雏，尔雏虽长心何如。\n将飞不飞犹未忍，古瑟写哀哀不尽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}